 n the canvas disappears?\nCode Meets Animation is an afternoon by the Swif
 tLah! Community and LottieFiles hosted by MyToday for developers, designer
 s and builders who want to bring motion into the way they already work. We
 ’ll look at what happens when animation becomes something you can descri
 be, generate and control in code, and how teams are…\n\nHosted by SwiftL
 ah! Community & 3 others
