SUMMARY:Startup School Malaysia 2026
DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/l22nw5yc\n\nAd
 dress:\nAsia School of Business (ASB) Academic\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia\n\n
 Startup School Malaysia is a full-day, hands-on program for founders. It r
 uns on Day 2 of Startup Week Malaysia 2026 at Asia School of Business, Kua
 la Lumpur.\nThe market has changed. Investors expect more, AI has reset wh
 at a small team can ship, and attention is harder to win. So this is not a
  day of sitting and listening. You'll feel leverage in a play-money tradin
 g game, pitch a deck you've never seen in PowerPoint Karaoke, find out who
  really wins in Trade to Victory, and test your idea with AI tools in a li
 ve lab.\nBetween games, get straight answers on raising in an AI-driven ma
 rket,…\n\nHosted by Daniel Cerventus
LOCATION:Asia School of Business (ASB) Academic, Level 1, 11, Jalan Dato O
 nn, Kuala Lumpur, 50480 Kuala Lumpur, Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur, Ma
