DESCRIPTION:Get up-to-date information at: https://luma.com/64vm5ekc\n\nAd
 dress:\nAsia School of Business (ASB) Academic\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia\n\n
 TuJU got Malaysians talking about navigation. If you've caught yourself sa
 ying “I could build something better,” bring your laptop.\nWe're putti
 ng that confidence to the test in a half-day hackathon. Your challenge is 
 to build a navigation app for a real Malaysian journey, put it online, and
  get people outside your team to try it.\nUse your favourite AI coding too
 ls and existing mapping and routing services. By the end, your team needs:
 \nA working app people can open on their phones.\nFive people outside your
  team who have tried it.\nA short demo\nA public post on social media sell
 ing your…\n\nHosted by Brendan Beh, Edward Low & Olivia Lim
